WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,650
Master, do they all have names?

2
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:05,430
Not yet, same as Yuanbao

3
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:08,170
You name them

4
00:00:08,170 --> 00:00:10,840
Thank you, Master, one black and one white

5
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:14,440
Then just call Xiao Hei and Xiao Bai directly.

6
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:16,240
the other two

7
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:20,440
A person with black body and white body is called Bai Qian

8
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:24,600
A person with a black body and a white body is called Mo Qian

9
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:28,940
Okay, do you remember your names?

10
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:32,948
Go back

11
00:00:32,948 --> 00:00:42,300
No more delivery

12
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:47,580
Master, I'll wait for you at home

13
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:58,030
The north of the city is deserted than the south

14
00:00:58,030 --> 00:01:02,780
There are soldiers and giant horses everywhere

15
00:01:02,780 --> 00:01:04,780
Recruiting troops and sending out a bunch of convoys

16
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:07,100
I'll look for the road to Huangsha Town first.
